sequenceDiagram
    participant Init as Init Container
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API
    participant KServe as KServe/ModelMesh<br/>Model Server
    participant Consumer as TrustyAI Consumer<br/>POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Reconciler as PayloadReconciler
    participant Storage as Storage Backend<br/>(PVC /inputs or MariaDB)
    participant Scheduler as PrometheusScheduler
    participant Metrics as /q/metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant User as User/Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>HTTP
    participant SvcIP as trustyai-service<br/>ClusterIP 80→8080

    Note over Init,K8s: Initialization Phase
    Init->>K8s: Create model-serving-config ConfigMap<br/>payloadProcessors URL =<br/>trustyai-service.{ns}/consumer/kserve/v2
    K8s-->>Init: ConfigMap created

    Note over KServe,Storage: Inference Payload Ingestion Flow
    KServe->>Consumer: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>InferencePartialPayload<br/>(input + output pairs)
    Consumer->>Reconciler: Forward partial payloads
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Join input-output pairs<br/>into structured dataframes
    Reconciler->>Storage: Store reconciled data
    Storage-->>Reconciler: Write confirmed
    Reconciler-->>Consumer: 200 OK
    Consumer-->>KServe: Acknowledged

    Note over Scheduler,Prometheus: Metric Computation & Export Flow
    Scheduler->>Storage: Read stored inference data
    Storage-->>Scheduler: Dataframes
    Scheduler->>Scheduler: Compute fairness metrics<br/>(SPD, DIR) & drift metrics<br/>(KS Test, Meanshift, Fourier MMD)
    Scheduler->>Metrics: Export computed metrics
    Prometheus->>Metrics: GET /q/metrics<br/>(prometheus.io/scrape annotation)
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: Metric values

    Note over User,SvcIP: On-demand Metric Request Flow
    User->>Route: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd
    Route->>SvcIP: Forward request
    SvcIP->>Consumer: Forward to container 8080
    Consumer->>Storage: Read inference data
    Storage-->>Consumer: Dataframes
    Consumer->>Consumer: Compute requested metric
    Consumer-->>SvcIP: Metric result (JSON)
    SvcIP-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: Metric result

    Note over User,Storage: Manual Data Upload Flow
    User->>Route: POST /data
    Route->>SvcIP: Forward request
    SvcIP->>Storage: Store uploaded data
    Storage-->>SvcIP: Write confirmed
    SvcIP-->>Route: 200 OK
    Route-->>User: Upload confirmed
